            <rect x='64' y='96' width='548' height='330' rx='12' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#D8E3EE' /><rect x='64' y='96' width='548' height='4' rx='2' fill='#1F5FA8' /><text x='82' y='130' fontSize='15.5' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F5FA8' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>2.3 射击：Bullet 类与开火（12.8）</text><text x='82' y='169.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· （1）子弹长什么样。 教材没有给子弹找图片，而是用 pygame.Rect 画一个细长条，</text><text x='82' y='188.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>再用 pyg…</text><text x='82' y='217.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· （2）存到编组里。 在主文件的 __init__ 里建一个空编组 self.bullets = Gro…</text><text x='82' y='245.5' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· （3）删除已消失的子弹。 子弹飞出屏幕顶部后要删掉，否则编组越涨越大，最终拖慢</text><text x='82' y='265.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>游戏。判断条件是 bul…</text><rect x='668' y='96' width='548' height='330' rx='12' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#D8E3EE' /><rect x='668' y='96' width='548' height='4' rx='2' fill='#1F5FA8' /><text x='686' y='130' fontSize='15.5' fontWeight='bold' fill='#1F5FA8' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>2.4 创建第一个外星人（13.2）</text><text x='686' y='169.0' fontSize='13' fill='#3A4A58' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>· Alien 和 Ship 结构几乎一样，都是「加载图片 → 拿 rect → 放位置」：</text><rect x='64' y='574' width='1152' height='66' rx='12' fill='#EEF5FB' /><text x='84' y='616' fontSize='14' fill='#243444' textAnchor='start' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>看不懂的地方先回讲义对应小节读一遍，再回来对着这页复述一次——能讲出来才算真懂。</text>
